WEBVTT

00:15.640 --> 00:17.250
<b>I don't mind.</b>

00:17.680 --> 00:19.750
<b>I'll let myself...</b>

00:20.060 --> 00:22.540
<b>be a sacrifice for you.</b>

00:22.720 --> 00:24.960
<b>In my place, please...</b>

00:24.960 --> 00:28.010
<b>continue living to your heart's content.</b>

00:28.010 --> 00:30.010
<b>And...</b>

00:30.010 --> 00:34.260
<b>take the Magecraft society
that took everything from our clan...</b>

00:34.650 --> 00:36.600
<b>and pulverize them!</b>

00:36.600 --> 00:38.850
<b>Papa... Mama...</b>

00:41.520 --> 00:46.570
<b>Oh, you have quite an interesting way
of putting up a struggle.</b>

00:53.990 --> 00:55.200
<b>An Einzbern...</b>

00:55.200 --> 00:56.950
<b>homunculus?</b>

00:56.950 --> 00:58.870
<b>Why are you here?</b>

01:01.080 --> 01:02.420
<b>My wounds...</b>

01:03.810 --> 01:05.040
<b>Wha...</b>

01:06.200 --> 01:07.250
<b>Here.</b>

01:07.430 --> 01:09.970
<b>This is your Master, see?</b>

01:09.970 --> 01:12.680
<b>You should hurry up and make the pact.</b>

01:15.110 --> 01:16.310
<b>Good boy.</b>

01:19.320 --> 01:20.570
<b>The path—</b>

01:20.570 --> 01:22.730
<b>Self-sacrificial Magecraft...</b>

01:22.730 --> 01:25.860
<b>wasn't uncommon back in my day.</b>

01:26.210 --> 01:30.070
<b>But at the least,
make sacrificing yourself look fun.</b>

01:31.630 --> 01:32.700
<b>Okay?</b>

01:34.490 --> 01:37.120
<b><i>Th-This woman is...</i></b>

01:37.120 --> 01:37.990
<b><i>not...</i></b>

01:39.590 --> 01:43.160
<b><i>Wh-Wh-Who in the world are you—</i></b>

01:43.160 --> 01:44.670
<b>Don't worry.</b>

01:44.670 --> 01:47.290
<b>I may look like this,
but I like humans, okay?</b>

01:47.470 --> 01:49.260
<b>Now that I'm here...</b>

01:49.260 --> 01:50.880
<b>all of you humanity...</b>

01:51.310 --> 01:53.880
<b>will be properly dominated!</b>

03:26.700 --> 03:28.690
<b><i>Livestock to Deficit.</i></b>

03:29.120 --> 03:32.620
<b><i>It seems you didn't attend
the scheduled report last night.</i></b>

03:32.620 --> 03:35.350
<b>I was assaulted by Assassin
immediately after the summoning,</b>

03:35.350 --> 03:36.400
<b>and I was passed out.</b>

03:37.270 --> 03:40.580
<b>Oh, the one that assaulted
the police station.</b>

03:40.580 --> 03:42.490
<b>I'm surprised you survived it.</b>

03:42.700 --> 03:45.830
<b>Saber happened to be
there, and he saved me.</b>

03:45.830 --> 03:46.950
<b><i>What?</i></b>

03:46.950 --> 03:49.540
<b>He proposed a ceasefire afterward...</b>

03:49.540 --> 03:50.960
<b>and I accepted.</b>

03:51.350 --> 03:53.310
<b><i>The same goes for Assassin.</i></b>

03:53.310 --> 03:55.670
<b>Then while you look into
more intel about them...</b>

03:56.060 --> 03:59.510
<b><i>suggest a united front
to deal with the King of Heroes...</i></b>

03:59.510 --> 04:02.220
<b><i>and the Lancer who is in line with him.</i></b>

04:02.220 --> 04:03.300
<b>Humph.</b>

04:03.300 --> 04:04.640
<b>Saber already...</b>

04:04.640 --> 04:08.480
<b>seems to have formed
an alliance with that Lancer.</b>

04:08.830 --> 04:12.400
<b><i>By the way, did you figure out
who your Heroic Spirit was?</i></b>

04:13.080 --> 04:14.320
<b>Yes.</b>

04:14.320 --> 04:15.270
<b>My Servant is—</b>

04:15.270 --> 04:16.780
<b>Watch out.</b>

04:16.780 --> 04:19.450
<b>Assassin is keeping watch behind you.</b>

04:21.510 --> 04:22.950
<b>Chaplin.</b>

04:23.380 --> 04:24.330
<b>Huh?</b>

04:24.720 --> 04:26.040
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

04:26.040 --> 04:27.660
<b>Can you repeat that?</b>

04:28.050 --> 04:30.410
<b>A Lancer. Charlie Chaplin.</b>

04:30.410 --> 04:33.380
<b>That's the Servant I summoned.</b>

04:33.810 --> 04:36.290
<b><i>I'll be asking him about his Noble
Phantasm among other things later.</i></b>

04:36.290 --> 04:37.960
<b><i>Now, if you'll excuse me.</i></b>

04:42.030 --> 04:45.220
<b>You're fine now. I don't
sense her anymore.</b>

04:49.240 --> 04:51.980
<b>Why didn't you take spirit form
if you knew she was there?</b>

04:51.980 --> 04:53.910
<b>Didn't I tell you?</b>

04:53.910 --> 04:56.730
<b>We are nothing more than Shadows.</b>

04:56.730 --> 05:01.070
<b>Only you, the Watcher's
Master, can see us.</b>

05:01.070 --> 05:03.320
<b>Tell me stuff like that sooner, would you?</b>

05:03.320 --> 05:03.950
<b>Hmm?</b>

05:04.720 --> 05:07.660
<b>That look on your face... Are you angry?</b>

05:09.010 --> 05:11.290
<b>You're such an easy read.</b>

05:12.930 --> 05:14.590
<b>Anyway, my boy...</b>

05:14.790 --> 05:17.000
<b>Chaplin, huh?</b>

05:17.000 --> 05:20.470
<b>Why a comedian of all people?</b>

05:20.470 --> 05:23.180
<b>He was the first to come to my mind
as someone of greatness.</b>

05:25.190 --> 05:26.550
<b>Can I come in?</b>

05:26.550 --> 05:27.390
<b>Who is it?</b>

05:27.600 --> 05:30.430
<b>Classical comedy is your thing.</b>

05:30.430 --> 05:31.850
<b>That's unexpected.</b>

05:31.850 --> 05:35.560
<b>I've watched comedy multiple times
and appreciate it.</b>

05:35.910 --> 05:38.480
<b>But I've never laughed
from the bottom of my heart.</b>

05:45.880 --> 05:48.080
<b>Hey, you can come in!</b>

05:50.220 --> 05:52.120
<b>Were you able to sleep
at least a little bit?</b>

05:52.120 --> 05:52.870
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:53.050 --> 05:55.670
<b>You were a lifesaver by
letting us use the room.</b>

05:55.670 --> 05:58.340
<b>Thanks to that, Ayaka is feeling good now.</b>

05:58.540 --> 06:00.050
<b>Um...</b>

06:00.400 --> 06:01.800
<b>What's your name?</b>

06:02.770 --> 06:04.510
<b>My name is Sigma.</b>

06:04.980 --> 06:07.970
<b>I'm one of the Masters
of the Holy Grail War.</b>

06:10.450 --> 06:13.640
<b>Did you figure out anything
about the case of that curse?</b>

06:13.640 --> 06:15.350
<b>Nothing on that end yet.</b>

06:15.350 --> 06:19.820
<b>However, I had a report that Halri Vorzak
is with an Einzbern homunculus...</b>

06:20.020 --> 06:22.990
<b>and is heading toward
the industrial district.</b>

06:22.990 --> 06:25.280
<b>Industrial district, huh?</b>

06:25.280 --> 06:29.200
<b>Is she planning to make contact
with the demon from the Scladio Family?</b>

06:41.000 --> 06:44.260
<b>So, is that the captain of the Argo?</b>

06:45.820 --> 06:47.470
<b>What do you mean?</b>

06:47.640 --> 06:50.760
<b>It's likely because we're connected
by Magical Energy paths,</b>

06:50.760 --> 06:53.520
<b>but your memories are encroaching into me.</b>

06:53.520 --> 06:56.250
<b>A noble-looking brat was mouthing off</b>

06:56.250 --> 06:59.270
<b>fantasies about an ideal
nation atop a boat.</b>

06:59.270 --> 07:00.400
<b>Hah!</b>

07:00.400 --> 07:05.280
<b>Someone speaking flights of fancy
of that nature must be him.</b>

07:05.630 --> 07:07.700
<b>A senseless man.</b>

07:07.700 --> 07:12.290
<b>Why did a great hero like you
become an oarsman for him?</b>

07:12.290 --> 07:16.600
<b>Indeed, he is a pitiful king
hell-bent on his desires,</b>

07:16.600 --> 07:19.250
<b>and he was a king that
spoke of idiotic dreams.</b>

07:19.600 --> 07:21.090
<b>However...</b>

07:21.090 --> 07:24.590
<b>that is exactly why he is my friend.</b>

07:24.590 --> 07:26.470
<b>I will not allow you...</b>

07:26.700 --> 07:29.970
<b>someone who did not board that ship,
to mock him so lightheartedly.</b>

07:29.970 --> 07:32.430
<b>I see. I understand now.</b>

07:32.430 --> 07:37.350
<b>I won't apologize, but I promise
I will never bring up this topic again.</b>

07:38.330 --> 07:39.770
<b><i>Mr. Cordelion!</i></b>

07:40.200 --> 07:41.520
<b>What's wrong?</b>

07:41.520 --> 07:42.980
<b>It's Ei... nzb...</b>

07:42.980 --> 07:45.990
<b>...'s homonc... is her...</b>

08:00.020 --> 08:03.250
<b>What does an Einzbern doll want with me?</b>

08:03.730 --> 08:05.250
<b>Oh, dear.</b>

08:05.250 --> 08:07.470
<b>You're covered in so much mud.</b>

08:07.670 --> 08:10.680
<b>You're already halfway out the door
from your humanity?</b>

08:10.680 --> 08:13.180
<b>Then, you wouldn't mind if I killed you...</b>

08:13.570 --> 08:16.390
<b>together with that twisted
Heroic Spirit there, right?</b>

08:16.390 --> 08:19.600
<b>Is that what the Einzberns want?</b>

08:19.600 --> 08:23.820
<b>Einzberns? You mean the people
who created this container?</b>

08:24.330 --> 08:25.940
<b>I was so lucky!</b>

08:25.940 --> 08:29.170
<b>This container hardly had
any soul formed in it,</b>

08:29.170 --> 08:31.860
<b>so I was able to possess it so easily.</b>

08:31.860 --> 08:36.740
<b>It's as if it was created for
the purpose of being a vessel for a god.</b>

08:36.740 --> 08:38.830
<b>A vessel for a god?</b>

08:38.830 --> 08:40.040
<b>Are you saying that...</b>

08:40.040 --> 08:42.710
<b>you are a god or something?</b>

08:42.710 --> 08:44.090
<b>That's right!</b>

08:44.090 --> 08:46.050
<b>A goddess, that is!</b>

08:46.270 --> 08:47.840
<b>What're you doing?</b>

09:01.950 --> 09:04.230
<b>You really have no manners.</b>

09:04.230 --> 09:06.520
<b>You tried to shoot a god dead.</b>

09:07.170 --> 09:12.860
<b>Self-proclaimed goddess,
why have you trampled into our base?</b>

09:12.860 --> 09:16.410
<b>Oh, this is a Holy Grail War, right?</b>

09:16.410 --> 09:20.580
<b>It's only natural to eradicate enemy
forces that don't strike your fancy.</b>

09:20.580 --> 09:25.590
<b>Though, I'm neither Master nor Servant!</b>

09:31.940 --> 09:34.800
<b>Th-The space is being transformed
into a labyrinth!</b>

09:34.800 --> 09:38.220
<b>Oh! You finally deployed
your bounded field?</b>

09:38.220 --> 09:40.980
<b>You're really taking your time here.</b>

09:40.980 --> 09:44.980
<b>No, this is how it was meant to be used.</b>

10:07.630 --> 10:09.590
<b>N-No way!</b>

10:13.550 --> 10:16.260
<b>To be able to deploy a bounded field
on such a giant workshop...</b>

10:16.260 --> 10:19.100
<b>and then transform it
into an underworld...</b>

10:19.100 --> 10:22.550
<b>That's a composite artwork
of the Scladio Family.</b>

10:22.550 --> 10:24.690
<b>It will be rather difficult...</b>

10:24.690 --> 10:27.020
<b>even for an adept Mage
to get out of there.</b>

10:29.170 --> 10:31.730
<b>Hmm, I see!</b>

10:31.730 --> 10:35.990
<b>You can tell whoever made this
must be an unpleasant personality.</b>

11:05.790 --> 11:10.230
<b>Was it on your order
that she came here, Halri Vorzak?</b>

11:10.230 --> 11:12.690
<b>I-I...</b>

11:12.690 --> 11:14.440
<b>I am...</b>

11:17.340 --> 11:18.860
<b><i>Papa!</i></b>

11:18.860 --> 11:20.320
<b><i>Mama!</i></b>

11:28.170 --> 11:31.790
<b>We came here at Ms. Philia's suggestion.</b>

11:32.350 --> 11:34.260
<b>I merely tagged along.</b>

11:34.490 --> 11:37.970
<b>I see. So, that thing is called "Philia."</b>

11:38.360 --> 11:40.390
<b>What is that thing?</b>

11:41.030 --> 11:43.600
<b>The person who saved my life.</b>

11:56.030 --> 11:58.280
<b>Stymphalian Birds?</b>

11:58.280 --> 11:59.990
<b>I see. Not bad.</b>

12:05.040 --> 12:06.450
<b>Ms. Philia!</b>

12:06.450 --> 12:08.580
<b>Looking the other way?
Such confidence.</b>

12:13.140 --> 12:14.210
<b>Hmm?</b>

12:22.700 --> 12:24.770
<b>Oh, what a good little one.</b>

12:24.770 --> 12:26.060
<b>Now, Halri!</b>

12:26.820 --> 12:29.520
<b>You're the Master,
so hurry up and give your orders.</b>

12:29.520 --> 12:30.310
<b>Huh?</b>

12:30.310 --> 12:33.150
<b>I'm asking you. Who is your enemy?</b>

12:33.150 --> 12:34.270
<b>If you let it be,</b>

12:34.270 --> 12:38.400
<b>it will kill off everyone
other than you and me. Is that okay?</b>

12:40.920 --> 12:42.500
<b>The enemy is...</b>

12:42.500 --> 12:44.080
<b>The enemy is...</b>

12:46.220 --> 12:47.410
<b>The enemy is...</b>

12:47.410 --> 12:49.120
<b>this magical workshop!</b>

12:49.510 --> 12:53.340
<b>Tear it down to pieces...</b>

12:53.340 --> 12:55.170
<b>Berserker!</b>

12:59.730 --> 13:02.220
<b>What is that?</b>

13:02.220 --> 13:03.800
<b>Ms. Halri...</b>

13:03.800 --> 13:05.510
<b>What in the world...</b>

13:07.220 --> 13:09.560
<b>did you summon?</b>

13:17.330 --> 13:18.990
<b>This is Ayaka.</b>

13:18.990 --> 13:22.610
<b>My Master... she is not,
but she's my partner.</b>

13:22.610 --> 13:25.030
<b>Nice to meet you... Sigma.</b>

13:25.240 --> 13:26.240
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:26.240 --> 13:27.350
<b>Oh...</b>

13:27.350 --> 13:31.290
<b>I assume it'd be too much to ask
to introduce me to your Servant.</b>

13:31.290 --> 13:33.460
<b>He called it "Chaplin."</b>

13:34.480 --> 13:36.250
<b>Chaplin as in...</b>

13:36.250 --> 13:38.420
<b>There was a movie at the
music club yesterday!</b>

13:38.420 --> 13:40.970
<b>I definitely would like an introduction!</b>

13:40.970 --> 13:44.150
<b>He says that actors are
to be seen in movies,</b>

13:44.150 --> 13:46.430
<b>so he doesn't show himself in person.</b>

13:46.430 --> 13:47.850
<b>I see.</b>

13:47.850 --> 13:48.850
<b>I can agree to that.</b>

13:48.850 --> 13:50.060
<b>You can?</b>

13:51.990 --> 13:54.980
<b>He was contacting someone.</b>

13:54.980 --> 13:57.190
<b>Who is the mastermind
pulling your strings?</b>

13:57.370 --> 13:58.690
<b>Answer me!</b>

13:58.690 --> 13:59.990
<b>Hold on!</b>

14:00.160 --> 14:02.070
<b>What will you do, my boy?</b>

14:02.670 --> 14:06.870
<b>I'm a mercenary, and I
was contacting my client.</b>

14:06.870 --> 14:08.120
<b>What?</b>

14:08.120 --> 14:09.950
<b>I can't say any further.</b>

14:09.950 --> 14:10.790
<b>But...</b>

14:10.790 --> 14:13.580
<b>I'd be in trouble if you kept
probing around, so please stop that.</b>

14:16.770 --> 14:19.300
<b>So honest! What an interesting fellow!</b>

14:19.300 --> 14:21.050
<b>You're one to say that.</b>

14:21.050 --> 14:22.800
<b>All right, how about this?</b>

14:22.800 --> 14:24.550
<b>Would you like to form
an alliance with us, as well?</b>

14:25.280 --> 14:28.030
<b>I can't share that much about myself,</b>

14:28.030 --> 14:30.680
<b>so I think it'll be difficult
to earn your trust.</b>

14:30.990 --> 14:34.310
<b>Therefore, I wouldn't mind agreeing
if it's a ceasefire.</b>

14:34.310 --> 14:36.020
<b>Hmm...</b>

14:36.750 --> 14:38.560
<b>Oh well, I guess that's okay!</b>

14:38.560 --> 14:40.360
<b>Have you lost your mind?</b>

14:40.360 --> 14:41.650
<b>It's not okay?</b>

14:43.340 --> 14:44.610
<b>I...</b>

14:44.610 --> 14:46.410
<b>decided, as well.</b>

14:46.410 --> 14:50.030
<b>That, at the least, I
will try to trust Saber.</b>

14:50.790 --> 14:53.450
<b>So, now, I will for you, as well.</b>

14:56.680 --> 14:57.920
<b>Hey, Saber.</b>

14:57.920 --> 15:02.420
<b>Is it possible for me to connect
the... path... was it... with this person?</b>

15:04.900 --> 15:07.010
<b>Yeah, leave that to me!</b>

15:09.110 --> 15:10.810
<b>My gratitude.</b>

15:11.780 --> 15:16.020
<b>That girl's got a surprising
amount of gusto.</b>

15:16.540 --> 15:18.900
<b>And that king, too.</b>

15:19.830 --> 15:21.070
<b>Be careful.</b>

15:22.500 --> 15:25.740
<b>Well, I think with that,
we have no objections.</b>

15:25.740 --> 15:28.240
<b>It may be only for a short while,
but nice to work with you...</b>

15:28.240 --> 15:29.950
<b>Sigma.</b>

15:52.610 --> 15:55.730
<b>Destroy the workshop, huh?</b>

15:55.930 --> 15:57.980
<b>You dodged that one pretty well.</b>

15:57.980 --> 16:00.690
<b>You don't tell it directly to kill?</b>

16:00.690 --> 16:03.690
<b>Oh, it's not like I dodged it...</b>

16:03.690 --> 16:06.280
<b>I'm not blaming you for anything, okay?</b>

16:06.280 --> 16:11.240
<b>I mean, Halri, if you were a kid
who would say "Kill people" so easily...</b>

16:11.240 --> 16:13.330
<b>you'd no longer be human—</b>

16:16.850 --> 16:19.580
<b>Now, you should run for it.</b>

16:19.580 --> 16:22.880
<b>If we're not careful in how we kill them,
mud will splatter everywhere.</b>

16:22.880 --> 16:25.170
<b>So, we have to be careful
how we get rid of them.</b>

16:26.020 --> 16:27.840
<b>No way! You're kidding!</b>

16:27.840 --> 16:29.760
<b>This is amazing, Halri!</b>

16:29.760 --> 16:31.400
<b>She was only brought in so we'd</b>

16:31.400 --> 16:34.350
<b>have enough people, but she
summoned something amazing!</b>

16:36.990 --> 16:40.770
<b>But... this scene is almost over.</b>

16:41.160 --> 16:43.730
<b>Well then, I'm going to
give the order, okay?</b>

16:43.730 --> 16:48.860
<b>I will have you cleanly wrap up
that battle between those monsters!</b>

16:49.710 --> 16:53.570
<b>That's an order I'd like to refuse
even if you used a Command Spell on me.</b>

16:53.880 --> 16:56.130
<b>We finally have all the actors,</b>

16:56.130 --> 16:59.460
<b>but if the folks above
Faldeus make their move,</b>

16:59.460 --> 17:03.170
<b>this perfect stage would be ruined,
don't you think?</b>

17:03.170 --> 17:06.380
<b>So... you'll head out there for me, right?</b>

17:14.990 --> 17:16.760
<b>You want me to stop this?</b>

17:17.200 --> 17:19.140
<b>Great! This is the best!</b>

17:19.140 --> 17:21.480
<b>This is the best, me!</b>

17:25.370 --> 17:30.490
<b><i>I mean, Halri, if you were a kid
who would say "Kill people" so easily...</i></b>

17:30.490 --> 17:32.530
<b><i>you'd no longer be human—</i></b>

17:32.840 --> 17:35.080
<b><i>You'd be categorized as a Mage,</i></b>

17:35.080 --> 17:37.370
<b><i>so you wouldn't be worth
keeping alive anymore.</i></b>

17:42.790 --> 17:46.670
<b>I don't care if you suck away
all of my Magical Energy!</b>

17:46.670 --> 17:47.810
<b>So, please!</b>

17:47.810 --> 17:49.130
<b>Please, destroy it!</b>

17:49.130 --> 17:51.130
<b>Destroy everything!</b>

17:51.900 --> 17:54.650
<b>What the Mages created!</b>

17:54.650 --> 17:56.010
<b>All of it!</b>

17:56.010 --> 17:57.180
<b>Everything!</b>

17:57.570 --> 17:58.970
<b>Everything!</b>

18:03.120 --> 18:05.520
<b>Halri Vorzak...</b>

18:05.520 --> 18:08.230
<b>What the hell did you summon?</b>

18:08.230 --> 18:13.070
<b>You think I'd easily disclose information
about a Servant?</b>

18:13.070 --> 18:16.620
<b>You either give me the info or order it
to commit suicide with a Command Spell.</b>

18:16.620 --> 18:18.660
<b>If you do that, I'll end you
without unnecessary pain.</b>

18:19.640 --> 18:24.420
<b>I see how it's not
"I'll at least spare you your life."</b>

18:25.020 --> 18:30.550
<b>I don't think you're such a foolish Mage
to believe in such nonsense.</b>

18:31.650 --> 18:34.760
<b>Me, a Mage, huh?</b>

18:36.150 --> 18:37.680
<b>All right.</b>

18:40.030 --> 18:41.850
<b>I order you with a Command Spell!</b>

18:42.810 --> 18:44.310
<b>Berserker!</b>

18:44.310 --> 18:46.480
<b>With all the strength you have,
take this city and—</b>

18:46.480 --> 18:47.560
<b><i>I pay tribute...</i></b>

18:47.770 --> 18:49.940
<b><i>Grand Illusion!</i></b>

18:55.510 --> 18:56.500
<b>This is...</b>

18:56.500 --> 18:59.030
<b>deceiving the texture of the world?</b>

18:59.340 --> 19:00.830
<b>How could they...</b>

19:02.050 --> 19:03.540
<b>Hello there.</b>

19:03.540 --> 19:05.670
<b>A lot of new faces here.</b>

19:06.970 --> 19:09.540
<b>What's the meaning of this, Caster?</b>

19:09.540 --> 19:10.710
<b>All in all,</b>

19:10.710 --> 19:13.670
<b>it's so that the Holy Grail War
continues safe and sound.</b>

19:13.880 --> 19:15.380
<b>Don't worry.</b>

19:15.380 --> 19:17.260
<b>I am on your side.</b>

19:17.260 --> 19:18.970
<b>I'm allies with humans.</b>

19:18.970 --> 19:20.680
<b>I'm allies with gods.</b>

19:21.070 --> 19:22.770
<b>I'm allies with Mages.</b>

19:22.770 --> 19:26.480
<b>So, I, to make sure all of
that doesn't get lost...</b>

19:26.870 --> 19:30.190
<b>only came here to prolong the fun.</b>

19:30.750 --> 19:34.070
<b>Why don't we strike a deal right now?</b>

19:34.710 --> 19:35.820
<b>With me...</b>

19:35.820 --> 19:39.660
<b>whom a foulmouthed crowd
called a "demon"...</b>

19:39.660 --> 19:41.330
<b>long ago.</b>

19:44.550 --> 19:45.750
<b>What is going on here?</b>

19:46.510 --> 19:48.420
<b>Just what did you do?</b>

19:49.680 --> 19:51.590
<b><i>It's just an illusion!</i></b>

19:51.760 --> 19:54.600
<b><i>Besides, the people who
were fighting there</i></b>

19:54.600 --> 19:57.550
<b><i>suddenly seem to have reconciled.</i></b>

19:57.550 --> 19:59.140
<b><i>Isn't that strange?</i></b>

19:59.140 --> 20:01.470
<b><i>Is it the power of love?</i></b>

20:01.470 --> 20:03.310
<b><i>Isn't it such a wonderful thing? Love!</i></b>

20:03.700 --> 20:06.670
<b><i>You can physically touch
and use the workshop...</i></b>

20:06.670 --> 20:08.230
<b><i>but in about five more days,</i></b>

20:08.230 --> 20:10.440
<b><i>the world will notice
and it will collapse!</i></b>

20:10.440 --> 20:13.480
<b><i>So, I trust you to do
the cover-up work in the meanwhile!</i></b>

20:19.170 --> 20:22.490
<b>Mr. Black, what is that?</b>

20:22.490 --> 20:25.370
<b>It looks like there was
a fire out in the city.</b>

20:25.580 --> 20:26.910
<b>Who's there?</b>

20:27.870 --> 20:30.460
<b>I'm Jester Karture.</b>

20:30.460 --> 20:31.580
<b>Nice to meet you...</b>

20:31.760 --> 20:33.290
<b>Tsubaki.</b>

20:33.640 --> 20:35.260
<b>Livestock to Thorn.</b>

20:35.460 --> 20:39.720
<b><i>Please send several members
of the squadron to watch over Deficit.</i></b>

20:41.180 --> 20:43.930
<b>Why surveillance on Sigma?</b>

20:43.930 --> 20:47.850
<b>I just remembered
that Mages are not to be trusted.</b>

20:47.850 --> 20:48.830
<b>Besides,</b>

20:48.830 --> 20:52.360
<b>it troubles me that he's pretending
to be an actor as it doesn't suit him.</b>

20:53.460 --> 20:58.690
<b>It looks like that guy Faldeus
is sending Thorn over here.</b>

20:59.670 --> 21:04.280
<b>You really aren't trusted one bit, my boy.</b>

21:04.630 --> 21:08.000
<b>"Suggest a united front," huh?</b>

21:11.100 --> 21:15.000
<b>My objectives are restful
sleep and stable meals.</b>

21:15.000 --> 21:16.210
<b>Huh?</b>

21:16.210 --> 21:17.800
<b>I'll give you information.</b>

21:17.800 --> 21:22.470
<b>This Holy Grail War has been set up
by the United States government.</b>

21:22.470 --> 21:25.680
<b>My client is one who
sides with the States.</b>

21:25.680 --> 21:27.270
<b>One of the masterminds.</b>

21:27.270 --> 21:29.930
<b>U-United States government?</b>

21:29.930 --> 21:31.480
<b>Mastermind?</b>

21:31.480 --> 21:36.190
<b>This Holy Grail War has
13 sets of Masters and Servants.</b>

21:36.190 --> 21:37.230
<b>Hold it! Wait up!</b>

21:37.230 --> 21:39.190
<b>Can you go in order, slowly?</b>

21:39.590 --> 21:44.740
<b>My client is the type that wipes out
allies once they're no longer of any use.</b>

21:44.740 --> 21:47.660
<b>So, I want to have a connection
with you guys, as well.</b>

21:47.660 --> 21:50.450
<b>You're using us as insurance?</b>

21:50.450 --> 21:52.160
<b>I don't mind if you think of it that way.</b>

21:54.230 --> 21:57.090
<b>You don't have to trust me.</b>

21:57.090 --> 22:01.340
<b>I will be utilizing you,
so you should utilize me, as well.</b>

22:02.440 --> 22:04.300
<b>All right. I get it.</b>

22:04.650 --> 22:07.220
<b>I will trust you.</b>

22:07.930 --> 22:09.930
<b>EPISODE 7</b>
